    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Feminine accusative",
     "texto": [
      "Many feminine nouns ending in -a change to -ę as the direct object. The feminine adjective changes too: **nowa książka → nową książkę**.",
      "Polish shows this function in the word itself; English shows it through word order alone."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
